This is the end of the code for the ToonTalk object.

NumberTyping = off
TextTyping = off
Flipping = off
UserPuzzle = off

Click on Pumpy's button until it shows 'N' so he'll make things narrower.

If you made the box too narrow, click on his button to get to 'W'
and Pumpy will make things wider.

I would just switch back and forth using Pumpy to Narrow or Widen
the box.  A shortcut is to just type 'n' or 'w' while holding Pumpy.

